<p class="lead"><strong>Thank you to every member who took part.</strong> Together, 847 owners gave us a clear result to take into our 24 September meeting with Jaguar Land Rover.</p>

<p>The survey is now closed. Members could select every route they would support, mark one of the three main routes as their preferred outcome, and add optional comments. Full HV Replacement leads both measures: it received the most selections and the most preferred votes.</p>

