<h2>What the result tells us</h2>
<p><strong>Full HV Replacement is the clear winner.</strong> Its 681 selections reflect owners’ wish to keep their I-PACE when a reliable repair can restore confidence without repeated visits. A Fair Buy Back also received substantial support, showing why a fair choice remains important for owners whose circumstances or confidence are different.</p>
<p>Fair Compensation and Additional Concerns were offered alongside the three main routes. Their totals show that resolving the battery question alone will not address every owner’s experience.</p>

<h2>501 comments will inform the detail</h2>
<p>Members submitted 501 optional comment entries across the five choices. Some members commented on more than one choice, so this is a count of comments rather than individual commenters. We will use those comments to understand recurring concerns and the practical detail behind the headline vote. We will not publish members’ free text here.</p>

<h2>Thank you for giving the group a clear voice</h2>
<p>Every response has helped turn individual experiences into evidence we can present clearly. We are taking the result into our discussion with JLR and will update members as the work progresses.</p>

